# Workspace agent rule

- Canonical policy: read and follow root `AGENTS.md` before resume or candidate-fact edits.
- Conflict order: user request → `AGENTS.md` → `CLAUDE.md` / this rule.
- Task docs + world-top skills index: `docs/AGENT_MARKDOWN_MAP.md`.
- NaukariPro package work: `playbooks/AGENTS.md` (dry-run apply until human approval).
- Project skills live in `.agents/skills/` (pinned by `skills-lock.json`). Restore with `npx skills experimental_install`.
- Never invent candidate facts, metrics, employers, or dates.
